# Target: .github/CODEOWNERS
#
# The shared set is the escape hatches and the two workflows every repo runs as
# a required check, not the whole tree. Keep these lines last — GitHub applies
# the LAST matching pattern, so a repo's own go above.
#
# There is no /.github/ line. The owner reviews a workflow only when it enforces
# a required check or gates a deploy, so a repo names its own such workflows
# (and the local actions they call) above these lines; Dependabot settings, issue
# and pull request templates and every other workflow are agent-reviewed.
/.standardsignore        @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.standards.mode         @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.docs-lint*             @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.standards-db-tooling   @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.github/CODEOWNERS      @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.github/workflows/standards.yml  @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.github/workflows/docs-lint.yml  @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
